%LCOsamu
%LC理
\dPhew... thank you for the food.\d%K%P
「呼，我吃饱了」%K%P
%LCKaya
%LC夏夜
\d...Was it good?\d%K%P
「…好吃吗？」%K%P
%LCOsamu
%LC理
\dYeah. As usual.\d%K%P
「嗯。跟往常一样」%K%P
%LCKaya
%LC夏夜
\dNhaha...\d%K%P
「呵呵…」%K%P
It was the usual conversation, after our usual dinner\ntogether.%K%P
一如往日的餐后，\n一如往日的互动。%K%P
I always answered that it tasted nice.\nAnd Kaya always gave me a blissful smile in return.%K%P
一直回答着『好吃』的我，\n还有一直开心笑着的夏夜。%K%P
Even when the rain fell, the wind howled, or the sun beat\ndown on the ground, our days remained unchanged.%K%P
雨之小白脸，风之小白脸。\n…不，不管是刮风天，还是下雨天，都是一成不变的日常。\n※译注：第一行句子的读音和第二行前半句的读音相同。%K%P
I always praised her food because it was genuinely tasty,\nbut was she really always happy when she smiled? Or did\nshe just go through the motions every time?%K%P
我是因为真的觉得好吃才重复着一样的回答的，\n但到底夏夜，真的是因为开心，才每天重复着同样的反应吗？%K%P
...With her, it could be either way.%K%P
………到底怎么回事儿呢，不过毕竟是她啊。%K%P
%LCKaya
%LC夏夜
\dUm, Osamu... I'll peel an apple for you.\nYou can relax over there in the meantime.\d%K%P
「呐，理君，我来削个苹果。\n在此期间，你来这里休息吧」%K%P
%LCOsamu
%LC理
\dI'm not sure my heart could handle that.\d%K%P
「…不要做这种危险的事」%K%P
%LCKaya
%LC夏夜
\dOh, don't start again.\nJust look at how soft my legs are.\d%K%P
「没事的。\n来来，这里的腿～很柔软的哦～」%K%P
Kaya tapped her thighs a few times while holding a fruit\nknife -- it was dangerous in multiple meanings of the\nword.%K%P
手里依然拿着水果刀，砰砰敲着自己的大腿的夏夜，\n进行着在某种意义上很危险的撒娇。\n面对这样的她，我带着苦笑叹出一口气。%K%P
In any case, I had no more time to play around.%K%P
但是今天，我不能这么磨蹭了。%K%P
%LCOsamu
%LC理
\dIt's about time for me to leave.\d%K%P
「那么，我差不多该走了」%K%P
I glanced at the clock displaying 8:05 and stood up.%K%P
我看着指向８点５分的时钟，\n站起身来…%K%P
%LCKaya
%LC夏夜
\dYou're... going today, too?\d%K%P
「今天…也要去啊」%K%P
%LCOsamu
%LC理
\dWell... yeah.\d%K%P
「不，那个…」%K%P
%LCKaya
%LC夏夜
\dYou're going to her place...\d%K%P
「要去…那个人的身边了…啊」%K%P
%LCOsamu
%LC理
\dH-Hey. What is this...?\d%K%P
「喂、喂，等等…」%K%P
Kaya's smile soon turned into a grimace of pain; she\nburied her face in her hands.%K%P
她刚才还是十分幸福的笑脸，\n现在一下子皱得变了形，并把双手捂在了脸上%K%P
%LCKaya
%LC夏夜
\dU...Uah... Hgh, khh, uahh...\d%K%P
「呜…呜呜…呜、咕、呜呜…唔」%K%P
%LCOsamu
%LC理
\dK-Kaya... I feel like I'm telling you the same thing\nevery day.\d%K%P
「夏、夏夜小姐…所以说，我平时不就在说吗？」%K%P
%LCKaya
%LC夏夜
\dI know... I understand...\nIt's 'real family day' for you.\d%K%P
「我知道…其实我知道的啊。今天是『正宫』之日啊…」%K%P
%LCOsamu
%LC理
\dR-Real family...?\d%K%P
「正、正宫…？」%K%P
%LCKaya
%LC夏夜
\dThat's right... You have a place to return to. Your\njealousy-crazed wife is waiting for you in that run-down\napartment.\d%K%P
「没错…对你来说，还有需要归去的地方。\n因为丑陋的嫉妒而发狂的夫人等待着的，\n那间破公寓」%K%P
%LCOsamu
%LC理
\dU-Um...\d%K%P
「那、那个…」%K%P
%LCKaya
%LC夏夜
\dBut, but... you can allow me to dream, at least\nsometimes!\d%K%P
「但是、但是…\n偶尔，也让我看一下自己的梦吧…」%K%P
%LCOsamu
%LC理
\dAre you sure the word \dsometimes\d really applies here?\d%K%P
「偶尔…是在说？」%K%P
%LCKaya
%LC夏夜
\dAt the very least, I want you on Saturday nights and\nSundays...\nIs that really too much to ask?\d%K%P
「至少，周六的晚上，还有周日我想要理君…\n这是不是，也是太奢侈了呢？」%K%P
%LCOsamu
%LC理
\dNo, I don't think so... Besides, we're already doing it\nevery week...\d%K%P
「不，一点也不奢侈。\n不如说，这个每周都…」%K%P
%LCKaya
%LC夏夜
\dAnswer me... Answer me, Osamu! Ugh... Waaaaah...!\d%K%P
「回答我…回答我啊，理君！\n呜、呜呜呜、呜哇啊啊」%K%P
