%LC理
\dI-I'm sorry!\d%K%P
「非、非常抱歉！」%K%P
%LCKaya
%LC夏夜
\dTsk...\d%K%P
「切…」%K%P
I learned this some time after we began living together,\nbut...%K%P
我最近才知道…%K%P
Apparently, Yasunaga wrote the script for Kaya's tear-\njerker acts.%K%P
夏夜每一次的哭戏，\n似乎都是由八须永君写的剧本…%K%P
Talk about a guy with too much free time on his hands...%K%P
那个男人，别弄得这么正经啊，我说真的…%K%P
