%LC夏夜
\dSays the guy who keeps forgetting his promises to me.\d%K%P
「明明和我的约定总是立刻就毁掉了～」%K%P
Well, she always kept trying to make me promise\nembarrassing things... Though I lacked the courage to say\nthat to her face.%K%P
『那是因为你总是要求做羞耻的事情』\n…这样的反驳我也不会做。%K%P
%LCOsamu
%LC理
\dIt's just, well... Ah, that's right! I was just thinking\nabout having a little after-dinner dessert first...\d%K%P
