%LCBuntarou
%LC文太郎
\dLet's see, now... \dI don't mind if it's once a month...\nno, even if it's once every six months. I want to make\nlove to you from early morning to late night in a place\nfar away, where no one can bother us.\d\d%K%P
「呃…『一个月一次，不，半年一次也没有关系。\n谁都不在的，小小的温泉旅馆里两人共处…想不受任何人打扰，\n从早到晚一直黏在一起。我的愿望只有这个』」%K%P
